\boldsymbol\mu_2^{*} =\arg \displaystyle{  \min_{\boldsymbol\mu_2}} \{ D_{KL}(p_{{\bf x}_1}\| p_{{\bf x}_2}) \} = \boldsymbol\mu_1.
